In Article 7 (1), "Minister of Health and Welfare" shall be replaced with "Minister of Health and Welfare, the Commissioner of the Korea Disease Control and Prevention Agency."
In Article 7 (2) 5, "Minister of Health and Welfare" shall be replaced with "Minister of Health and Welfare or the Commissioner of the Korea Disease Control and Prevention Agency."
Article 13 shall be replaced with the following:
"Article 13 (Delegation and Entrustment)
(1) Part of the authority or duties of the Minister of Health and Welfare under this Act may be delegated to the Commissioner of the Korea Disease Control and Prevention Agency, the heads of affiliated agencies, or Mayors/Do Governors, or entrusted to corporations or organizations related to cardio-cerebrovascular diseases, as prescribed by Presidential Decree.
(2) Part of the authority or duties of the Commissioner of the Korea Disease Control and Prevention Agency under this Act may be delegated to Mayors/Do Governors or entrusted to corporations or organizations related to cardio-cerebrovascular diseases, as prescribed by Presidential Decree."
(21) through (33) Omitted.
Article 5 Omitted.

ADDENDA <Act No. 18897, June 10, 2022>
Article 1 (Enforcement Date)
