In Article 2, subparagraph 4 (f), "cardio-cerebrovascular disease centers under Article 9" shall be replaced with "the central cardio-cerebrovascular disease center under Article 12 and regional and local cardio-cerebrovascular disease centers under Article 13."

ADDENDA (Act Partially Amending Four Acts, including the Public Health Control Act, for the Comprehensive Transfer of Central Administrative Powers and Affairs to Local Governments) <Act No. 20171, January 30, 2024>
Article 1 (Enforcement Date)
